
📖 Surah Al-Fil (Surah #105)

Ye Surah ek bohot mashhoor waaqiya yaad dilati hai jo Nabi ﷺ ke paidaish ke saal hua tha, jise "Aam-ul-Feel" (Haathi wala saal) kaha jata hai.
________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
🌟 Waaqiya ka Pas-e-Manzar:

Yemen ka hukmaran Abraha ek bohot bada church (Qulays) banata hai taa ke log uski taraf aayen aur Ka’aba ko bhool jayein.
Lekin Arab logon ki muhabbat aur ta’zeem Ka’aba ke liye itni gehri thi ke Abraha ko ghussa aaya.
Usne faisla kiya ke Makkah aakar Ka’aba ko gira de.
Uske paas ek baraa lashkar tha jismein haathi bhi the (sabse bara haathi “Mahmood” tha).

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌟 Allah ki Qudrat ka Zohar:

Jab Abraha aur uska lashkar Ka’aba ko todne ke liye Makkah ke qareeb aaye, to Allah Ta’ala ne apne chhote chhote parinday (Ababil) bhej diye.
In parindo ke chonch aur panjon mein pathar (sijjeel ke pathar) the jo unhone Abraha ke lashkar par barsaye.
Har ek pathar se sipahi jal gaya, toot gaya aur tabah ho gaya.
Pura lashkar mitti ke choore ke jaise barbad ho gaya.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌟 Surah ka Paighaam:

Allah apne ghar (Ka’aba) ka Hafiz hai – koi bhi taaqat usay nuqsaan nahi pohncha sakti.
Bari se bari quwwat aur technology bhi Allah ke muqable mein kuch nahi – jaise bade bade haathi aur lashkar bhi chhote parindo ke samne kuch na ban sake.
Yeh waaqiya Quraysh ke liye ek daleel tha ke Allah ne unke ghar ko bacha kar unki izzat barhayi, isliye unhe sirf Allah ki ibadat karni chahiye.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayah 1: أَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِأَصْحَابِ الْفِيلِ

“Kya tumne nahi dekha ke tumhare Rab ne Haathi walon ke sath kya kiya?”
🔹 Matlab: Allah Quraysh ko yaad dila raha hai ke Abraha ka lashkar jo Ka’aba girane aaya tha, usko Allah ne kaise tabah kiya.
🔹 Sabq: Allah ke ghar (Ka’aba) ki hifazat sirf Allah karta hai, insano ki quwwat bekaar hai.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayah 2: أَلَمْ يَجْعَلْ كَيْدَهُمْ فِي تَضْلِيلٍ

“Kya Allah ne unki chal ko nakaam nahi bana diya?”
🔹 Matlab: Abraha ka maqsad tha Ka’aba ko giraana, lekin Allah ne uski planning ulta kar di aur sab zaya kar diya.
🔹 Sabq: Duniya ke bade se bade plan bhi Allah ke samne nakaam ho jate hain.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayah 3: وَأَرْسَلَ عَلَيْهِمْ طَيْرًا أَبَابِيلَ

“Aur Allah ne unpar jhund jhund k parinday bhej diye.”
🔹 Matlab: Allah ne chhote parinday bheje jo groups mein aaye aur Abraha ke lashkar par hamla kiya.
🔹 Sabq: Chhoti si makhlooq bhi Allah ke hukum se badi taaqat ko mita sakti hai.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayah 4: تَرْمِيهِمْ بِحِجَارَةٍ مِّن سِجِّيلٍ

“Jo unpar pathar barsa rahe the baked clay (sijjeel) ke.”
🔹 Matlab: Har parinda apne panje aur chonch mein chhota pathar lekar aya jo un sipahiyon par giraaya jata.
🔹 Ye pathar aam pathar nahi the – Allah ne khaas azaab banaya tha.
🔹 Sabq: Allah ki qudrat insaan ke khayal se bahut upar hai.
________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

✅Ayah 5: فَجَعَلَهُمْ كَعَصْفٍ مَّأْكُولٍ

“Aur unhe aise bana diya jaise khaye hue bhoosay (chura chura ho gaye).”
🔹 Matlab: Allah ne unke jism ko aise tor diya jaise kheton ka bhusa jo jaanwar chaba kar fek dete hain.
🔹 Sabq: Allah ke azaab se koi nahi bach sakta.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌟 Kull Sabq:

Allah apne ghar ka hami-o-nasir hai.
Badi se badi quwwat Allah ke samne kuch bhi nahi.
Banda sirf Allah par bharosa rakhe.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌟 Hamare Liye Sabq:

Jab mushkilat ka samna ho to sirf Allah par bharosa rakho.
Chhoti si quwwat bhi jab Allah ke saath ho, to sabse badi quwwat ko hara sakti hai.
Allah ki qudrat insaan ki samajh se bahar hai – uske liye kuch bhi mushkil nahi.

________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

👉 Matlab ye Surah ek yaad-dihani hai ke duniya ki sabse bari power bhi Allah ke samne kuch nahi hai.
